egistered. The question: \"Bleibt N bis zur Umsetzung pending — als pending-Zeile oder als Abwesenheit?\" We need to choose a verdict. Likely best is A: implement new directives to register constants. Reason: ensures N can be computed, avoids pending. Riss: lack of existing parser arm for scalar constants. So Riss: missing parser arm.\n\nR-f: gfc-Block. Options: A D=2190 (official part), B Cap 3211, C full D=5540, D D=760 or Cap 719. The question: \"Epoche — Volltextbeleg suchen, statischen Compiler-Pfad bauen, oder keinen Block setzen? ttl NO_CADENCE=33554432 s?\" We need to choose. Likely choose A: D=2190, official part, smaller size, easier to handle. Reason: manageable size, official, no epoch issue. Riss: missing epoch specification. So Riss: epoch not set.\n\nR-g: P10-Restarme. Options: A build all arms; B minimal safe subset; C nothing; D each rest separate form. Likely choose B: minimal safe subset (kg/(m^2 s)-Parserfix + Stern-Metadaten-Achse). Reason: reduces complexity, covers key data. Riss: missing quantity/kanal arm for other groups. So Riss: missing quantity arm for other groups.\n\nLet's craft answers.\n\nNeed to keep format exactly: `R-b Verdikt: <A|B|C|D> — Begründung: <zwei Sätze> — Riss: <...>`\n\nSimilarly for R-f and R-g.\n\nLet's produce.\n\n"},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":797,"completion_tokens":824,"total_tokens":1621,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":64}}}